---
import { bandStyle } from '../../lib/band';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ResearchCards from '../../components/ResearchCards.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="Research"
  description="Active research lines of Manuel Soler: contrail observation, contrail modelling and climate-optimized aircraft trajectories."
>
  <section class="pband" style={await bandStyle('sky')}>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="pband__eyebrow">Research</p>
      <h1>Contrails, climate and the way aircraft fly</h1>
      <p class="pband__lead">
        Aviation warms the planet through CO₂ and, to a similar or larger extent, through contrails and other non-CO₂
        effects. My current work follows the problem end to end: observing contrails, modelling them, and optimising
        trajectories to avoid the ones that matter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ResearchCards />
      <p class="lab-note">
        This research is carried out with the team of the <a href={site.labUrl}>{site.labName}</a> at UC3M, where the
        group's wider activity in AI for aviation, trajectory optimisation and sustainable aviation technologies is
        described.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lab-note {
    margin: 44px 0 0;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    max-width: 75ch;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
